+- Only managers may freeze a project (`POST /projects/{pid}/freeze`); other
+  readers get 403. Freezing sets every member's role to `viewer`, including the
+  managers, so after a freeze no one can write to the project's tasks (403).
+  Freezing is a one-way operation in this API: no endpoint restores roles, and
+  a frozen project has no manager left to freeze it again.
+- Archived projects reject all writes with 409 (reads still work), including freeze.
 - A task ID that does not belong to the project in the path → 404.
 
